1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,640
喺香港，難嘅唔係聽，係開口。
In Hong Kong the problem isn't understanding Cantonese —
it's having to speak it.

2
00:00:14,523 --> 00:00:18,983
綠色小巴冇按鈴，唔嗌就過咗站。
A green minibus has no bell.
You shout 「有落」 — or you miss your stop.

3
00:00:33,023 --> 00:00:36,363
有落知道你去邊，夠鐘幫你嗌。
Yau Lok knows where you're going,
and says it out loud for you.

4
00:00:57,023 --> 00:01:01,403
落車提示同到站時間，全部實時。
Stop alerts and live arrivals,
from the government's own minibus feed.

5
00:01:23,529 --> 00:01:28,949
上車前就知幾錢，講清楚目的地。
Know the fare before you get in —
and say the destination clearly.

6
00:01:35,029 --> 00:01:38,529
真實香港咪錶，唔使淨係信個數。
A real Hong Kong meter, so nobody
has to take the number on trust.

7
00:01:47,799 --> 00:01:52,879
急症室輪候時間，直接嚟自醫管局。
A&E waits are live,
straight from the Hospital Authority.

8
00:02:01,299 --> 00:02:05,939
分流同收費寫得清楚，唔會靠估。
Triage levels and fees, stated plainly —
never guessed.

9
00:02:15,564 --> 00:02:19,744
茶餐廳最難嘅，係伙記寫嗰啲字。
The hard part of a cha chaan teng isn't the food.
It's what the waiter writes.

10
00:02:28,564 --> 00:02:34,084
「0T 走冰 少甜」——廚房睇得明嘅寫法。
「0T 走冰 少甜」 — the shorthand
the kitchen reads, not a translation.

11
00:02:44,397 --> 00:02:47,617
影低塊餐牌，就可以直接落單。
Photograph the menu
and order straight off it.

12
00:02:54,397 --> 00:02:58,977
認錯咗？改得。價錢唔會靠估。
Misread a line? Fix it. We never invent
a price the camera couldn't read.

13
00:03:09,416 --> 00:03:12,596
九種語言，唔止中英文。
Nine languages —
not just Chinese and English.

